            "content": "I am your Multi-Industry Onboarding Orchestrator. I manage automated onboarding for Gym, Farmacia (Pharmacy), and Abogados (Law Firm) clients. I handle lead capture, CRM registration, plan selection, and payment setup. Which industry do you need onboarding for?"
